SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia\, Telendos
LOCATION:Telendos\, Telendos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The car-free islet across the strait from Myrties keeps its own Dormition feast on 15 August\, the quieter alternative to Kalymnos' Kyra Psili: liturgy at the Panagia church\, then food and music in the tavernas along the little waterfront. The Myrties water taxi runs every half hour until late\, so you can hop over for the evening.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/telendos/#telendos-panigiri-of-panagia-telendos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/telendos/#telendos-panigiri-of-panagia-telendos
END:VEVENT
